#AREA Elven City~

#AUTHORS Deadblt~

#HELPS
-1 ELVEN_CITY_CHANGES~
03.29.09 - Corrected an issue that prevented the extending blade from
           working properly. (Order)
03.29.09 - Changed items (Salves, Statuettes, Songbooks, etc...) that
           claimed to work with Monks to work with Clerics as intended.
03.29.09 - Reformatted the books.  Added color.
03.29.09 - Rope of entanglement now sets the victim's speed to walk.
~

-1 Elven City~
Elven City
----------
The Elven council claims to have discovered new forms of magic never
seen in the Realms before.  Their 'City' is intended to be a center of 
commerce, so that all the 'sub-races' of the Realms can buy their goods.

     (-) Other Mud Areas by Deadbolt

This area was added to on May 26 1998 by

     (a) Jaxom

{-}Deadbolt
{a}JAXOM
~
0 $~

