{000}     {007} If the user is of good alignment     {020}
{000}     {007} they can open a doorway to a realm   {020}
{000}     {007} of peace and healing.                {020}
{000}     {007}                                      {020}
{000}     {007} The Black Crystal:                   {020}
{000}     {007} If the user is of evil alignment     {020}
{000}     {007} they will open a doorway to the      {020}
{000}     {007} nether realms.  There they will gain {020}
{000}     {007} power and escape their enemies.      {020}
{000}     {007}                                      {020}
{000}     {007} The Clear Crystal:                   {020}
{000}     {007} If the user is of neutral alignment  {020}
{000}     {007} they can open a doorway to a realm   {020}
{000}     {007} of unity and balance.  There they    {020}
{000}     {007} may rest from their many trials.     {020}
{000}     {007}                                      {020}
