{000}     {007}                                        {020}
{000}     {007}    To use your Elven City Statuette    {020}
{000}     {007} you must hold the statuette and        {020}
{000}     {007} conjure the creature trapped within.   {020}
{000}     {007}                                        {020}
{000}     {007} Only Illusionists, Elementalists and   {020}
{000}     {007} Necromancers may use the statuettes.   {020}
{000}     {007}                                        {020}
{000}     {007} Angel Statuette:                       {020}
{000}     {007} Using this statuette conjures an angel {020}
{000}     {007} to call the blessings of heaven upon   {020}
{000}     {007} all in the room.                       {020}
{000}     {007}                                        {020}
{000}     {007} Panther Statuette:                     {020}
{000}     {007} Using the Panther Statuette conjures a {020}
{000}     {007} powerful spirit to prepare warriors    {020}
{000}     {007} for battle.                            {020}
{000}     {007}                                        {020}
{000}     {007} Woodlands Statuette:                   {020}
