#12137
blade extending eblade121~
an extending blade~
There is an average looking longsword here.~
There is an engraving near the pommel..

The command `fold` turns the blade into a dagger.

- The Elven Council =]~
ITEM_TYPE_WEAPON
ITEM_FLAG_MAGIC|ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_WIELD
0 6 4 WEAPON_SLASH
8 9000 30
A
APPLY_DAMROLL 4
A
APPLY_AC 8
C
quick-draw~
FLAG_CLASS_ROGUE|FLAG_CLASS_RANGER|FLAG_CLASS_ASSASSIN
P 1
TRIG_UNKNOWN 100 fold
  OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC ! WEAR_NONE 2 0

P 2
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    remove eblade121 & mposet i12137 value3 2 & wield eblade121~

P 2
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_ECHO
    Your extending blade becomes shorter.~

P 2
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_QUEST_SET 0 1 1

P 3
TRIG_DAMAGE 75
  OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 1 = 1 4 0

P 4
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC ! WEAR_NONE 5 0

P 5
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_ECHO
    Your blade extends to full length~

P 5
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
    remove eblade121 & mpoadd eblade121 value3 1 & wield eblade121~

P 5
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_ECHO
    You momentarily lose your grip on your blade but quickly rearm yourself.~

P 5
TRIG_VOID
  OPROG_QUEST_SET 0 1 2
