P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
mpoadd bshield121 value0 1~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_QUEST_ADD 0 3 1
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_ECHO
Your blood-shield becomes a bit larger.~
P 4
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_HIT -25
P 5
TRIG_TICK 15
OPROG_OBJECT_QUEST_IF 0 3  > 0 6 0
P 6
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC = WEAR_NONE 7 0
P 7
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_GOD_COMMAND
mpoadd bshield121 value0 -1~
